# 110024.com environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local only if you need to override something.
# .env.local must never be committed.
#
# Note: the GA4 Measurement ID is hardcoded in components/GoogleAnalytics.tsx
# and is deliberately not an env var. A GA4 Measurement ID is published in
# client-side JavaScript anyway, so there is nothing to protect.